# The release and test workflows check a gnolang/gno tree out HERE, because
# actions/checkout cannot place one outside the workspace. goreleaser refuses to
# build from a tree with untracked files in it, so without this line every
# release fails on "git is in a dirty state" naming a 400MB directory that CI
# put there on purpose.
/gnoroot/
